Error [jet.ImmutableAssignment]: `cur` was made with `:`, so it can't be changed
  --> tests/ui/iter_cursor_immutable_binding.jet:20:12
    |
 20 |     a: cur.next()
    |            ^^^^
 Why: `next: fn(&self)` changes the value it's called on, so `cur` must be mutable (`:=`)
 Fix: Declare it with `cur := ...`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0111
